<title>USA: Exactech Inc Q4 full results.</title>
<headline>Exactech Inc Q4 full results.</headline>
<dateline>GAINESVILLE, Fla. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>EXACTECH, INC.</p>
<p>		    SUMMARY OF SALES AND EARNINGS - (Unaudited)</p>
<p>For the Fourth Quarter Ended December 31, 1996 and 1995</p>
<p>						 1996		  1995</p>
<p> Net Sales			   $3,758,829	   $2,912,837</p>
<p> Gross Profit			 2,523,185	    1,872,400</p>
<p> Operating Expenses		 1,955,394	    1,302,640</p>
<p> Other Income (Expense)		82,065	   ( 111,236)</p>
<p> Income before income taxes	 649,856		458,524</p>
<p> Net Income			     411,759		292,410</p>
<p> Earnings per common share	     0.08		   0.10</p>
<p> *Number of shares		  5,100,000	    3,022,735</p>
<p>		 For the Year Ended December 31, 1996 and 1995</p>
<p>						1996		    1995</p>
<p> Net Sales			  $13,839,976	    $9,118,075</p>
<p> Gross Profit			 9,156,101	     6,122,120</p>
<p> Operating Expenses		 6,703,437	     4,642,462</p>
<p> Other Income (Expense)		52,850	    ( 124,937)</p>
<p> Income before income taxes     2,505,514		 804,130</p>
<p> Earnings per common share	     0.37		    0.27</p>
<p> *Number of shares		  4,150,584	     3,022,735</p>
<p>NOTE: *Weighted average number of shares used in computing earnings per common share.</p>
<p>Company conducted an initial public offering of its common stock on May 30, 1996.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
